- Aave liquidation mechanics: https://github.com/aave/aave-v3-core/blob/master/contracts/protocol/libraries/logic/LiquidationLogic.sol
- Uniswap Base factory deployment: https://developers.uniswap.org/docs/protocols/v3/deployments/v3-base-deployments

These source references explain interface/mechanics. They do not attest byte-for-byte equivalence of the historical implementation, which is recorded by address and code hash in the report.
